const n='---\ntitle: "Qingpu Tenant Keys"\ndescription: "Theme-private API for issuing, rotating, revoking, and verifying tenant authorization keys"\n---\n\n# Qingpu Tenant Keys API\n\nThis module provides a theme-private PostgreSQL implementation for managing tenant authorization keys under the `qingpu` theme. It does not add any tables to the global `server/db/schema.*` files.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Configure `QINGPU_DATABASE_URL` or reuse `DATABASE_URL`.\n2. Execute the SQL file at `app/themes/qingpu/database/tenant_authorization_keys.sql`.\n3. Call the theme API endpoints under `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/*`.\n\n## Storage Rules\n\n- Raw API keys are returned only when a key is created or rotated.\n- The database stores only `api_key_hash` and `api_key_prefix`.\n- `subscriptionId` links back to APayShop subscriptions, while `subscriptionSnapshot` preserves a point-in-time copy of plan data.\n\n---\n\n## 1. List Tenant Keys\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys`\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session)\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": [\n    {\n      "id": 12,\n      "userId": 7,\n      "subscriptionId": "sub_123",\n      "productId": 3,\n      "orderId": "ORD20260706001",\n      "tenantName": "Acme Team",\n      "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n      "keyLabel": "production",\n      "apiKeyPreview": "qpk_live_bd30c7****************",\n      "status": "active",\n      "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",\n      "issuedAt": "2026-07-06T09:00:00.000Z",\n      "lastUsedAt": null,\n      "revokedAt": null,\n      "revokedReason": null,\n      "meta": {\n        "env": "prod"\n      },\n      "subscriptionSnapshot": {\n        "productName": "Qingpu Pro",\n        "interval": "month"\n      },\n      "createdAt": "2026-07-06T09:00:00.000Z",\n      "updatedAt": "2026-07-06T09:00:00.000Z"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Create Tenant Key\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "tenantName": "Acme Team",\n  "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n  "keyLabel": "production",\n  "subscriptionId": "sub_123",\n  "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",\n  "orderId": "ORD20260706001",\n  "meta": {\n    "env": "prod"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "message": "Tenant key created successfully",\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n    "status": "active",\n    "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"\n  },\n  "rawKey": "qpk_live_3bfc7f4d4fdd2ef8..."\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Get Tenant Key Detail\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/detail?id=12`\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session)\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "userId": 7,\n    "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n    "status": "active",\n    "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. Rotate Tenant Key\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/rotate`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "id": 12,\n  "expiresAt": "2026-08-15T00:00:00.000Z"\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "message": "Tenant key rotated successfully",\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "status": "active"\n  },\n  "rawKey": "qpk_live_71f2f31554ce3fd5..."\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Revoke Tenant Key\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/revoke`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "id": 12,\n  "reason": "Tenant offboarded"\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "message": "Tenant key revoked successfully",\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "status": "revoked",\n    "revokedReason": "Tenant offboarded"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 6. Verify Tenant Key\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/verify`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Not required\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "apiKey": "qpk_live_3bfc7f4d4fdd2ef8...",\n  "tenantCode": "acme-team"\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "valid": true,\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "userId": 7,\n    "subscriptionId": "sub_123",\n    "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n    "status": "active",\n    "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Error Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "statusCode": 401,\n  "message": "Tenant key has expired"\n}\n```\n';export{n as default};
